sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming> a pk:Claim ;
        rdfs:label "Bi et al. (2015) & Park et al. (2015) zero-temperature shape-index unjamming & asthmatic bronchial epithelial rigidity transition faithfully reproduces Human (Homo sapiens) bronchial epithelial monolayer & Drosophila epithelial sheet morphology" ;
        dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Human (Homo sapiens) bronchial epithelial monolayer & Drosophila epithelial sheet specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 91.0/100, audit 2026-10-19-vertex-glass-jamming-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
        dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/0cb0132/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py> ;
        pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/0cb0132/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py; output: docs/media/vertex_glass_jamming_comparison.png; organism: Human (Homo sapiens) bronchial epithelial monolayer & Drosophila epithelial sheet; checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/0cb0132; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 52abc2dcaa2857a7c9b54a7d8ac8d7ebb1e0481dc0dc957ca72fa6bc9190d466; artifact_sha256: 6b4fc774e8883b673018abcacc3e2f6d0542ce1dcba17f0f1c75210d9cc7c224; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-vertex-glass-jamming-audit; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Bi, Lopez, Schwarz & Manning (2015) Nature Physics Eqs. 1-2 & Figs. 1-4: dimensionless vertex energy e = (1/2) sum [(a_i - 1)^2 + r(p_i - p_0)^2] exhibits a density-independent rigidity transition at critical target shape index p_0^* approx 3.813 (> p_5 approx 3.8119 > p_hex approx 3.7224), where T1 energy barrier Delta e_T1(p_0) and static shear modulus G(p_0) vanish identically for p_0 >= p_0^*. | Park et al. (2015) Nature Materials Figs. 1-4 & Atia et al. (2018) Nature Physics Figs. 1-2: primary human bronchial epithelial cells (HBECs) from non-asthmatic donors jam into a solid monolayer by Day 14 (q = 3.792 < 3.813), whereas asthmatic donor HBECs (q = 3.955 > 3.813) and mechanically compressed HBECs (30 cm H2O, q = 3.945 > 3.813) remain unjammed, with standardized cell shapes obeying a universal k-Gamma distribution.; reconstructed_in_script: 2D periodic confluent monolayer vertex-Voronoi simulation across 4 regimes (Non-Asthmatic Solid p_0=3.70, Critical Point p_0^*=3.813, Asthmatic Fluid p_0=3.955, and Zero-Perimeter-Modulus Ablation r=0.0), 8-point p_0 phase sweep in [3.55, 4.00], and Park et al. (2015) Days 3-18 bronchial maturation trajectories. | Junction-guided Voronoi segmentation of the human in situ monolayer micrograph (`human_epithelial_monolayer_specimen.jpg`, N=101 interior cells, <q>=3.7961, k-Gamma correlation r = 0.9334).; transfer_boundary: 2D apical polygonal projection of pseudostratified bronchial and simple monolayer epithelia.; does_not_claim: Does not model 3D mucociliary beating hydrodynamics or sub-epithelial airway smooth muscle contraction.]" ;
        pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1038/nmat4357>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1038/nphys3471>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1038/s41567-018-0089-9>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevX.6.021011>,
            <https://doi.org/10.1140/epje/i2010-10677-0> ;
        pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-code-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-model-fidelity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-morphometric-validation>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-overall>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-parameter-expressivity>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-repro-package>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-source-traceability>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bi-vertex-glass-jamming-specimen-match> ;
        pk:weightOfEvidence "0.91"^^xsd:double .
    <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/0cb0132/2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py> a schema:SoftwareSourceCode ;
        rdfs:label "2015-bi-vertex-glass-jamming.py" ;
        schema:codeRepository <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib> ;
        schema:programmingLanguage "Python" ;
        schema:version "0cb0132" .
}

